---
layout: base/base.njk
title: "Packages"
description: "Flexible sleep coaching packages to suit every family. Find the right level of support for your little one
and book your consultation with It Takes a Village today."
---

<section class="pt-[180px] pb-[180px] sticky top-0 z-5 bg-cream">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <h1 class="text-navy heading-1-bold" data-reveal>Packages</h1>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Approach section -->
<section class="bg-white py-[80px] relative z-10">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-[60px]">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-[20px]">
          <h2 class="text-terqoise heading-2-bold text-center" data-reveal>Our Approach</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[10px]">
          <p class="body text-navy text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">At It Takes A Village, we support families all over the world.</p>
          <p class="body text-navy text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="200">Our approach is simple and effective, take a look below: </p>
          </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- connecting dashed line, desktop only -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 top-1.5 bottom-1.5 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(to_bottom,var(--color-terqoise)_0_8px,transparent_8px_16px)]"></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-[40px] lg:gap-[44px]">

        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_60px_1fr] items-center gap-3 lg:gap-0">
          <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-start-2 flex justify-center relative z-10">
            <span class="w-[44px] h-[44px] rounded-full bg-terqoise text-white flex items-center justify-center body-bold" data-reveal>1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[6px] order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-start-1 text-center lg:text-right lg:pr-[24px]" data-reveal="left">
            <h3 class="heading-5-bold text-terqoise">Tailored to your family</h3>
            <p class="body text-navy max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
              We know there is no one-size-fits-all approach to sleep, which is why every plan is tailored to your
              family's culture, values, lifestyle, time zone and, most importantly, your child.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_60px_1fr] items-center gap-3 lg:gap-0">
          <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-start-2 flex justify-center relative z-10">
            <span class="w-[44px] h-[44px] rounded-full bg-orange text-white flex items-center justify-center body-bold" data-reveal>2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[6px] order-2 lg:order-3 lg:col-start-3 text-center lg:text-left lg:pr-[24px]" data-reveal="right">
            <h3 class="heading-5-bold text-terqoise">No cry-it-out, ever</h3>
            <p class="body text-navy max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
              We don't use cry it out, Ferber, or any other form of extinction-based sleep
              training. Instead, our approach is rooted in the latest evidence and an
              understanding of your child's biology and development. Every plan is adapted to
              suit your child's temperament, your parenting style, and your family's goals.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_60px_1fr] items-center gap-3 lg:gap-0">
          <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-start-2 flex justify-center relative z-10">
            <span class="w-[44px] h-[44px] rounded-full bg-purple text-white flex items-center justify-center body-bold" data-reveal>3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-[6px] order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-start-1 text-center lg:text-right lg:pr-[24px]" data-reveal="left">
            <h3 class="heading-5-bold text-terqoise">What we ask of you</h3>
            <p class="body text-navy max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
              All we ask is that you stay consistent, trust the process, and make the most of
              your follow-up support. When we work together and keep the momentum going, we're
              confident we can help you make meaningful, lasting progress towards better sleep
              for your whole family.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>



        </div>
      </div>



    <div class="absolute top-[-100px] left-0 w-screen h-[100px] overflow-hidden">
    <img src="/assets/svgs/section-cloud.svg" aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top">
  </div>
</section>

